H37YjofyVptdm8AmgxQ9aPw8XW_usmPeBCUK1pv_9bWzuVA1ExJ_0uNOiVHdGq_zUCRk0aEF5pJb-SFvXFrJiON8DzXE1E5p6MV02nBzk1uHW8aebjPtUsKCv9FjXvn3cVUDtrZ9x5xoGGKqmzRMgZmGrgPEPWtsugopKIUOe-WJjCDDiArandcbXoyi3AhoRCjqM7UOg4NqCyOJ_ECn1eWnX85ywoN3Av4TsfHvkA6YblD-nvI6DXoNFcR6UFGCku0fHC5XL5H6blmhCA1OpZpHm285SX37nGTaEfIbFPrM0bwaV_gEQYtKHaKXQwJycO-mLho8PQY2WlHh-a1l4zoZV-qqaJC0si-YrXnVNyhi-N5CXc1_CmBRa9oOI791PJhV0vsQaIBypudao2ZBEJX5fiQnx3coxvcvhSAtQHPed02MnK4es7xqIlq_agxzUJnDBesWjX4_n2wm6axatuaiGf0R4odwkK2EgJWoxkZRRlpsNWBrkdyNZ9x0MM14HaB7pnKn0tc-6ycudL5z93YGkTw9yADwjDw13Psf_lkcYZ3w6ERGEcy26leY-tho4d8t9HyZjiRBjCVPyb1phtejqHPReqLPqGzRZ3ykTKN4rtAuEwacq69SOkbJDhMcKeQ==","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Verifying derivative-based inequality equality conditions**"},{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Formulating calculus-based AM-GM proof with equality**"}]},{"id":"msg_08b09184d24cd135016aa4125f62e087d0aa1bd49242cfe435","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"**证明一：加权 AM-GM 不等式**\n\n由 \\(abc=1\\)，有\n\\[\na^2=a^3bc,\\qquad b^2=ab^3c,\\qquad c^2=abc^3.\n\\]\n因此只需证明\n\\[\na^5+b^5+c^5\\ge a^3bc+ab^3c+abc^3.\n\\]\n\n由加权 AM-GM 不等式，\n\\[\n\\frac35a^5+\\frac15b^5+\\frac15c^5\n\\ge (a^5)^{3/5}(b^5)^{1/5}(c^5)^{1/5}\n=a^3bc,\n\\]\n即\n\\[\n3a^5+b^5+c^5\\ge 5a^3bc.\n\\]\n循环交换 \\(a,b,c\\)，还可得到\n\\[\na^5+3b^5+c^5\\ge 5ab^3c,\n\\]\n\\[\na^5+b^5+3c^5\\ge 5abc^3.\n\\]\n将三式相加，得到\n\\[\n5(a^5+b^5+c^5)\n\\ge 5(a^3bc+ab^3c+abc^3).\n\\]\n故\n\\[\na^5+b^5+c^5\\ge a^2+b^2+c^2.\n\\]\n\n---\n\n**证明二：对数代换与导数法**\n\n令\n\\[\nx=\\ln a,\\qquad y=\\ln b,\\qquad z=\\ln c.\n\\]\n由于 \\(abc=1\\)，所以\n\\[\nx+y+z=0.\n\\]\n\n定义\n\\[\nF(t)=e^{tx}+e^{ty}+e^{tz}\\qquad (t\\ge 0).\n\\]\n则\n\\[\nF(5)=a^5+b^5+c^5,\\qquad F(2)=a^2+b^2+c^2.\n\\]\n\n下面证明 \\(F(t)\\) 在 \\(t\\ge0\\) 上单调不减。注意\n\\[\nF'(t)=xe^{tx}+ye^{ty}+ze^{tz}.\n\\]\n利用 \\(x+y+z=0\\)，有\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n3F'(t)\n={}\u0026(x-y)(e^{tx}-e^{ty})\\\\\n\u0026+(x-z)(e^{tx}-e^{tz})\\\\\n\u0026+(y-z)(e^{ty}-e^{tz}).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n当 \\(t\\ge0\\) 时，函数 \\(u\\mapsto e^{tu}\\) 单调不减，因此每一项都满足\n\\[\n(x-y)(e^{tx}-e^{ty})\\ge0,\n\\]\n以及类似的不等式。于是\n\\[\nF'(t)\\ge0\\qquad (t\\ge0).\n\\]\n所以\n\\[\nF(5)\\ge F(2),\n\\]\n即\n\\[\n\\boxed{a^5+b^5+c^5\\ge a^2+b^2+c^2}.\n\\]\n\n此证明只使用了对数代换、导数以及单调性，没有使用 Jensen 不等式或幂平均不等式。\n\n---\n\n**等号情况**\n\n在第一种证明中，加权 AM-GM 取等要求\n\\[\na^5=b^5=c^5,\n\\]\n由于 \\(a,b,c\u003e0\\)，故\n\\[\na=b=c.\n\\]\n结合 \\(abc=1\\)，得到\n\\[\na=b=c=1.\n\\]\n\n在第二种证明中，若不全相等，则对于每个 \\(t\u003e0\\)，上面的三个差积中至少有一个严格为正，从而 \\(F'(t)\u003e0\\)，于是\n\\[\nF(5)\u003eF(2).\n\\]\n因此等号同样只在\n\\[\n\\boxed{a=b=c=1}\n\\]\n时成立。"}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":"88476d8c-cb46-449c-99e8-ae7bc566f84e","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":"detailed"},"safety_identifier":"user-svVqHx8SMpYzREMEgiSa0gLR","service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"attribution":{"items":{"msg_08b09184d24cd135016aa411cfb96087d0ab74aa5c4b1a1a83":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0,"content":[{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0,"input_tokens":73,"output_tokens":0}],"input_tokens":73,"output_tokens":0},"rs_08b09184d24cd135016aa411e3011c87d084808fadc72d265a":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0,"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":516},"rs_08b09184d24cd135016aa411f88e5887d0bee5e39cbeeea9fb":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0,"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":518},"rs_08b09184d24cd135016aa4120f39a087d082bdd47097bc6a11":{"cache_write_tokens":0,